      "parameters": {
        "content": "## A · AI4SG Overview\nClick **Execute workflow**: the **run page** opens. Choose countries, languages, source types and how many sources to analyse, then **Start run**. The same run page is always at /form/ai4sg-run (locally http://localhost:5678/form/ai4sg-run), behind the page login in `.env`.\nSearch (workflow B) and Extract & Interpretation (workflow C) run the two expert skills. Results go to the audit page (workflow D): http://localhost:5678/webhook/ai4sg-audit",
        "width": 1980,
        "height": 130
      },
      "id": "3ebfed2c-4da4-5dbb-8062-4421475b3ff3",
      "name": "Note · title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### ⚙️ Run page = this run's settings\n- Countries (+ other countries)\n- Search languages: local / English\n- Source types\n- Topic focus, published from (year)\n- Max web searches\n- Max results per search\n- Max sources to analyse\n- Relevance screen: broad / balanced / strict\n\nChosen each time; the skill files are not edited for a run.",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 270,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "0d145fca-c896-5121-990d-cad44994935d",
      "name": "Run settings",
