        "content": "### 🧑‍🔬 Expert deliverables = the interface\n`skills/search/SKILL.md`: what counts as AI for Social Good; how to search each source type; local-language keywords; trusted sites; each country's ISO code and local languages.  → used by **B · Search** (and by the relevance screen in C)\n`skills/extraction/SKILL.md` + `skills/extraction/examples/`: the fields to extract, how to interpret them (cost, benefit, beneficiaries, strength of evidence …), and the experts' own worked extractions.  → used by **C · Extract & Interpretation**",
        "width": 1560,
